{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pin-Bang-Shot! is a pachinko strategy game that combines elements of pinball, roguelite, and turn-based combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888430/extras/7ee8ff5f80bb0e3e4bd6996b809574d0.poster.avif?t=1760086348\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888430/extras/7ee8ff5f80bb0e3e4bd6996b809574d0.webm?t=1760086348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888430/extras/7ee8ff5f80bb0e3e4bd6996b809574d0.mp4?t=1760086348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bullets Fly, Gangsters Fall!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every adventure, you\u2019ll acquire a variety of powerful bullets and equipment, each with unique abilities that can impact battles in unexpected approaches. Collect ammunition, adjust firing sequences, choose optimal paths, and deal devastating damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gang legends, guarding your journey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During adventures, you can recruit up to three gang leaders for powerful support. Their skills are distinctive, and upon upgrading, they permanently join your crew. Flexibly switch partners to make challenges endlessly thrilling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Builds, Endless Thrills!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over hundreds of bullets and equipment, and more to come in future updates, every run features randomly generated paths and enemies, making each adventure a fresh new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revenge...... or Redemption?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the gang, some foes are exceptionally formidable - watch out for them, and some of them seem have old scores to settle with you. As you progress through the ride, any deeper schemes hidden beneath it all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888430/extras/39e2fa0f9a4bc5f6bcdb5db492877e41.avif?t=1760086348\" width=120 height=129 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888430?t=1760086348","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888430?t=1760086348","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888430/bf6649677235b9325d75cb7cc028c85e655da4c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760086348","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888430/bf6649677235b9325d75cb7cc028c85e655da4c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760086348","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3953290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pin-Bang-Shot! is a pachinko strategy game that combines elements of pinball, roguelite, and turn-based combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888430/extras/7ee8ff5f80bb0e3e4bd6996b809574d0.poster.avif?t=1760086348\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888430/extras/7ee8ff5f80bb0e3e4bd6996b809574d0.webm?t=1760086348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888430/extras/7ee8ff5f80bb0e3e4bd6996b809574d0.mp4?t=1760086348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bullets Fly, Gangsters Fall!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every adventure, you\u2019ll acquire a variety of powerful bullets and equipment, each with unique abilities that can impact battles in unexpected approaches. Collect ammunition, adjust firing sequences, choose optimal paths, and deal devastating damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gang legends, guarding your journey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During adventures, you can recruit up to three gang leaders for powerful support. Their skills are distinctive, and upon upgrading, they permanently join your crew. Flexibly switch partners to make challenges endlessly thrilling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Builds, Endless Thrills!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over hundreds of bullets and equipment, and more to come in future updates, every run features randomly generated paths and enemies, making each adventure a fresh new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revenge...... or Redemption?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the gang, some foes are exceptionally formidable - watch out for them, and some of them seem have old scores to settle with you. As you progress through the ride, any deeper schemes hidden beneath it all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888430/extras/39e2fa0f9a4bc5f6bcdb5db492877e41.avif?t=1760086348\" width=120 height=129 /></span></p>","developers":["Goodfella"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akama